0017:     Rule:
0018:     - Match each tool to a frame whose cavity size equals one of its color-region counts.
0019:     - Rotate/flip the tool so one color fills the cavity exactly; the other stays outside.
0020:     - If the docking orientation uses a reflection, swap the tool's two colors.
0021: 
0022:     Key insight: Cavity size determines tool–frame pairing; reflection triggers color swap.
